msgid "Filter with `if`: the `WHERE`"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:131
msgid "Add `if condition` at the end, and only the items that pass go into the new list:"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:148
msgid "In SQL: `SELECT d FROM days WHERE d > 90`. With both parts - a new value **and** a filter:"
