#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:307 site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:568 site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:940
msgid "The same in pandas"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:308
msgid "In pandas (session 14) you do not loop at all - an operation on a column works on all its values:"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:319
msgid "The idea is the same as a comprehension: a new column from an old one, with a filter."
msgstr ""

